+% Article III.A.3 — detached garage, up to 10 percent of the building limit.
+% Written by hand after the run: the draft listed the detached-garage
+% sublimit among its known simplifications, and held-out claim SYN-03-C3 was
+% paid 0 instead of 11,000. VII.R.4.d settles a detached garage at actual cash
+% value; the claimed amount here is that value.
+rule detached_garage_amount with provenance the policy at article III.A.3,
+    confer "Coverage is limited to no more than 10 percent of the limit of liability on the dwelling.":
+the settlement amount before deductible for a claim component is an amount P
+    if the claim component seeks coverage under Coverage A
+    and the claim component concerns a property
+    and the property is a detached garage
+    and the claim component belongs to a claim
+    and the claim arises under a policy
+    and the schedule for the policy states a limit of an amount L, a basis, for Coverage A
+    and S = L / 10
+    and the claim component claims an amount C
+    and the minimum of C and S is P.
